      "t": "To reach Elena's locked room above the kitchen, Chef Barinov climbs into the ventilation shaft and gets stuck. Admitting to Max that it is time to take responsibility for his actions, Viktor inspires Max to speak to Vika through the vent and promise to stand by her and their daughter.",
